    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47820" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλπ-ωρή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>warming</i>: metaph.,
				<i>comfort, consolation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ ἔτ᾽ ἄλλη θαλπωρή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.412
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.167
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ δὲ θαλπωρᾶν [θῆκα γονεῦσι
				γόους</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.623
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Argos</span>): pl., <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				128
			</span></i>.—In late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				8.243c
			</span></i>.</div>
